      <activity id="fcf9be06-fd79-556b-b62f-2e033291bed5" activityNameId="d6e02bb2-743b-5fa6-b1b4-fefc69a81da1" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xx Wind power plant 150kW, moving parts</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xx Wind power plant 150kW, moving parts
Lifetime is assumed to be 20 years. Annual electricity production is assumed to be 125 MWh. Most data are from a specific wind power plant, installed 1994 in Grenchenberg, Switzerland, a few are extrapolations from the module "wind power plant 30kW, moving parts".;
UUID: c743bb08-e1e6-3de6-8c4f-11425b4c3673
Includes materials used for moving parts: rotor, nacelle, electric parts, and their disposal. Also includes the prozessing, the energy requirements for assembling, the transports needed, and  the connection to the grid.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Data for a specific Swiss 150 kW wind power plant, installed in the year 1994.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_c743bb08-e1e6-3de6-8c4f-11425b4c3673.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
